      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Steel wire is an extremely useful and versatile material that can be found in many things you use everyday in the home, as well as in the car you drive. It is also useful in commercial, industrial and military applications—for cleaning, for spring-loaded devices, for reinforcing, for structural integrity, and even for making music. Steel wire is a metallic, cylindrical, and flexible strand that is commonly used to conduct electricity. It can form a wire rope which has even more uses in both private and public sector industries.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "钢丝是一种非常有用且用途广泛的材料，在许多日常家居用品和汽车中都能找到它的身影。它还可用于商业、工业和军事领域--清洁、弹簧装置、加固、结构完整性，甚至用于制作音乐。钢丝是一种金属丝，呈圆柱形，有韧性，通常用于导电。它可以形成钢丝绳，在私营和公共行业中用途更广。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
